{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《2026香港小姐競選》湖南外景拍攝期間，黃嘉雯日前發動突擊行動，闖入 4 號佳麗譚雅文（Tiffany）與 10 號佳麗陳梓穎（Cecilia）的酒店房間，為大家揭開候選佳麗行李箱內的秘密物品！</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8d7980a5-1191-4639-8f53-981f7f63b3dd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026aCBMHFc4es1784023203.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8d7980a5-1191-4639-8f53-981f7f63b3dd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_5f4615eaf21c31b1-425\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">擁有模特兒身型的譚雅文（Tiffany），打開行李後反差極大，竟然是一位收藏豐富的「零食大戶」，箱內放滿紫菜、紫薯條等各式小吃。除了零食，她還大方分享美齒秘訣，隨身攜帶洗牙器以確保口腔潔淨。此外，她更拿出爸爸送的神秘黑色布帶腰包，並進行搞笑示範，令現場氣氛相當歡樂。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_5f4615eaf21c31b1-426\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">陳梓穎（Cecilia）的行李則顯得非常實用與貼心。她展示了一個可愛的花栗鼠化妝包，內裡裝滿各種護膚霜與眼藥水，並表示由於皮膚乾燥，保濕面霜是她的護膚必備品。最引人注目的，是她準備了一個按星期分格的圓形藥丸盒，用以存放維他命 B。陳梓穎解釋，由於長期受到濕疹困擾，每日定時補充維他命 B 有助於改善皮膚狀況。</p><p id=\"p-rc_5f4615eaf21c31b1-426\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a97ee471-e9f5-4cb3-928f-b7b2058fd2aa.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026MPgBS3NYVR1784023238.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a97ee471-e9f5-4cb3-928f-b7b2058fd2aa.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_5f4615eaf21c31b1-427\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">當被問到是否有壞習慣或打鼾問題時，兩人笑言彼此休息狀況良好，每天收工沐浴後都能「秒瞓」。不過，她們亦自爆前一晚因為提早回房，兩人在房內興奮地聊天，不知不覺竟然聊到凌晨三點多，展現出佳麗間深厚的閨蜜情誼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T11:19:49.467765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":489,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}